  "abstract": "Covers TypeSpec 1.x from Microsoft for design-first HTTP APIs: language basics, @typespec/http routes, parameters, bodies, status codes, files, visibility and authentication, the @typespec/openapi3 emitter with its openapi-versions option (3.0.0, 3.1.0 and 3.2.0, default 3.0.0) and other options, the TypeSpec to OpenAPI mapping and @typespec/openapi decorators, API versioning with @typespec/versioning, tsp-openapi3 conversion, and project configuration and CLI. Pinned to compiler, http, openapi and openapi3 1.16.0 and versioning 0.86.0. SKILL.md holds the invariants and workflow; references split out project setup, language, HTTP, the emitter and versioning.",
